+## Embedded media-player device selection
+
+The C API also supports per-context selection without mutating `DA_DEVICE`:
+`da_capi_load_ex()` accepts `DA_CAPI_DEVICE_DEFAULT`, `AUTO`, `CPU`, or `NAMED`.
